135
00:04:48,658 --> 00:04:50,319
[SPEAKER_03]: Yeah, he just thought he was sick.

136
00:04:52,020 --> 00:04:53,201
[SPEAKER_03]: Oh, he was a beautiful player.

137
00:04:53,221 --> 00:05:00,525
