138
00:05:00,825 --> 00:05:02,646
[SPEAKER_03]: Oh, yeah, that's right, yeah.

139
00:05:05,267 --> 00:05:08,069
[SPEAKER_04]: So Bernard signed you then, is that right?

140
00:05:08,309 --> 00:05:09,030
[SPEAKER_04]: Yeah.

141
00:05:09,050 --> 00:05:10,791
[SPEAKER_04]: And did you get much money from Cleveland?

142
00:05:10,931 --> 00:05:12,091
[SPEAKER_04]: Not very much.

143
00:05:12,311 --> 00:05:13,512
[SPEAKER_04]: Not very much.

144
00:05:13,532 --> 00:05:16,093
[SPEAKER_04]: Did you join the team then, the end of the season?

145
00:05:16,834 --> 00:05:17,955
[SPEAKER_03]: Not the end of the season.

146
00:05:17,975 --> 00:05:20,176
[SPEAKER_03]: During the season, in August, I think it was.

147
00:05:21,540 --> 00:05:22,560
[SPEAKER_03]: I met him in Chicago.

148
00:05:25,881 --> 00:05:26,941
[SPEAKER_03]: Who was their first baseman?

149
00:05:28,441 --> 00:05:28,901
[SPEAKER_03]: Gando.

150
00:05:29,282 --> 00:05:29,882
[SPEAKER_03]: Oh, Chick Gando.

151
00:05:30,002 --> 00:05:30,242
[SPEAKER_04]: Yeah.

152
00:05:30,282 --> 00:05:32,122
[SPEAKER_04]: He was from around here, wasn't he?

153
00:05:32,642 --> 00:05:33,923
[SPEAKER_03]: Yeah, he just died recently.

154
00:05:33,943 --> 00:05:35,303
[SPEAKER_03]: He was in Calisoga.

155
00:05:36,003 --> 00:05:38,563
[SPEAKER_03]: His home was Berkeley, I think, originally from Berkeley.

156
00:05:39,484 --> 00:05:40,504
[SPEAKER_03]: He was involved there.

157
00:05:41,224 --> 00:05:44,025
[SPEAKER_04]: Yeah.

158
00:05:44,245 --> 00:05:48,826
