159
00:05:48,866 --> 00:05:49,286
[SPEAKER_04]: Yeah.

160
00:05:49,566 --> 00:05:50,286
[SPEAKER_03]: Yeah, a few.

161
00:05:50,326 --> 00:05:51,026
[SPEAKER_03]: Not very many.

162
00:05:52,790 --> 00:06:00,114
[SPEAKER_03]: And the war came on and that finished it.

163
00:06:00,714 --> 00:06:02,715
