164
00:06:02,755 --> 00:06:06,757
[SPEAKER_04]: Yeah, down in New Orleans.

165
00:06:06,777 --> 00:06:09,438
[SPEAKER_04]: You got in, it says here, about 73 games that year.

166
00:06:10,038 --> 00:06:11,119
[SPEAKER_04]: Yeah, something like that.

167
00:06:11,139 --> 00:06:15,441
[SPEAKER_03]: Yeah, but you got to be playing every day.

168
00:06:15,581 --> 00:06:17,162
[SPEAKER_03]: You got to be playing every day.

169
00:06:18,864 --> 00:06:20,705
[SPEAKER_03]: from one day to the other, you know.

170
00:06:20,725 --> 00:06:22,106
