179
00:06:48,660 --> 00:06:50,901
[SPEAKER_03]: Jack Rainey was there, yeah.

180
00:06:50,921 --> 00:06:51,661
[SPEAKER_03]: Steve O'Neill?

181
00:06:52,682 --> 00:06:53,762
[SPEAKER_03]: Warmbier was there.

182
00:06:53,782 --> 00:06:55,103
[SPEAKER_03]: Warmbier, Joe Warmbier.

183
00:06:55,123 --> 00:06:57,384
[SPEAKER_03]: He was a dear, friendly neighbor of ours.

184
00:06:57,404 --> 00:06:58,085
[SPEAKER_03]: Joe Sewell.

185
00:06:58,585 --> 00:07:01,466
