186
00:07:01,486 --> 00:07:02,147
[SPEAKER_03]: Joe Sewell.

187
00:07:02,867 --> 00:07:03,487
[SPEAKER_03]: Barry Gardner.

188
00:07:03,748 --> 00:07:04,628
[SPEAKER_03]: Barry Gardner.

189
00:07:05,048 --> 00:07:06,409
[SPEAKER_03]: I was thinking about it last night.

